[00:28.53]Summary of the meeting I am attaching the minutes of the last class meeting for your review.
[00:36.17]The summary of the meeting on contributing to Project Hope is as follows.
[00:42.88]Firstly,
[00:43.90]moved by the noble cause of Project Hope and encouraged by what has been achieved so far,
[00:49.13]we agreed to contribute our bit to the project by offering financial
[00:54.13]aid to a senior high student in a remote area of Sichuan Province.
[01:00.16]Secondly,
[01:01.30]we would seek out a girl whose family cannot afford her education.
[01:05.26]Lastly,
[01:06.14]our plan is to pay for her tuition on an annual basis 
[01:11.14]until she graduates from high school.
